# hesh-ups

Behavior: `docs/SPEC.md`. File layout: `docs/LAYOUT.md`. `AGENTS.md` for ship/tests.

- One Windows systray binary. Bind `127.0.0.1`. No Twitch/TTS/chat/goals.
- Operator language is one family per job. `.cursor/rules/operator-words.mdc`.
- Pinned deps only. No extra HTTP framework, ORM, second WS lib, obs-websocket helper, Wails, Fyne, npm.
- `go test`: app `Serve` on `127.0.0.1:0` with a temp DB. No `httptest`. Never exec the exe, never start tray/WebView, never `Listen` on `:18745`.
- Live check: the one tray on `http://127.0.0.1:18745` (health, state, popup, overlay, triggers, `/ws`). If `GET /api/health` fails, start it with `just run` (real `%APPDATA%\hesh-ups`, product port). Do not copy that folder. Do not set `HESH_UPS_DB` or `HESH_UPS_HTTP`. Do not bind another port. If health already succeeds, do not start another process.
- Overlay/composer/triggers live in `cmd/hesh-ups/web/` and embed. No disk UI, no AppData skins.
- Pages: `docs/` on `master`. No second site tree.
- Work on `master`. Ship it = commit + push. No PRs unless asked.
